sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as 管理员
    participant L as admin/layout.tsx
    participant OV as admin/page.tsx (RSC)
    participant AS as AdminService
    participant AU as AuditService
    participant DB as Prisma / SQLite
    participant PJ as admin/projects/page.tsx (RSC)
    participant PT as ProjectsTable (Client)
    participant BA as POST /api/admin/projects/batch
    participant US as admin/users/page.tsx (RSC)
    participant UB as POST /api/admin/users/:id/ban
    participant CC as admin/cleanup/page.tsx (RSC)
    participant CR as POST /api/admin/cleanup/run

    Note over A,L: 访问任意 /admin/*
    L->>L: getSession() + isAdminRole()
    alt 非 ADMIN
        L-->>A: redirect /login?next=/admin
    else ADMIN
        L-->>A: AdminShell 侧栏 + 子页面
    end

    Note over A,OV: 概览页
    OV->>AS: overview()
    AS->>DB: count / aggregate（并行 6 组）
    DB-->>AS: metrics
    OV->>AS: listCleanupLogs({pageSize: 8})
    AS-->>OV: recentLogs
    OV-->>A: 6 张指标卡 + 最近清理日志

    Note over A,PJ: 作品管理
    PJ->>AS: listProjects({status,visibility,q,page})
    AS->>DB: count + findMany(include author/stats)
    DB-->>AS: rows
    AS-->>PJ: AdminProjectDTO[]
    PJ-->>A: 筛选条 + 表格（initialRows）

    A->>PT: 筛选 / 翻页 / 行操作（下架/恢复/删除/续期/可见性/置顶）
    PT->>BA: POST {operation, ids, payload}
    BA->>BA: requireAdmin()
    BA->>AS: batchOps(input, actor)
    loop 每个 id
        AS->>DB: 查 project → 应用操作（purge 走 storage.removeProjectDir）
        AS->>AU: writeAudit(admin.project.{op}, meta{slug,title,before,after})
        AU->>DB: INSERT AuditLog
    end
    AS-->>BA: {successCount, failCount, results}
    BA-->>PT: ok(...)
    PT->>PT: toast 结果 + router.refresh()

    Note over A,US: 用户管理
    US->>AS: listUsers({q,role,status,page})
    AS->>DB: findMany + groupBy(projectCount)
    AS-->>US: AdminUserDTO[]
    A->>UB: POST {action:'ban'}
    UB->>UB: requireAdmin()
    UB->>AS: setUserBan(id, action, actor)
    AS->>DB: UPDATE status（拒绝 ADMIN/自身）
    AS->>AU: writeAudit(admin.user.ban)
    AS-->>UB: {id, status}
    UB-->>A: ok(...)

    Note over A,CC: 清理中心
    CC->>AS: listCleanupLogs({page,pageSize})
    AS-->>CC: CleanupLogDTO[]
    A->>CR: POST（手动触发）
    CR->>CR: requireAdmin() 或 X-Admin-Token
    CR->>CR: runAll() → 写 CleanupLog
    CR->>AU: writeAudit(admin.cleanup.run, meta{batchId,totals})
    CR-->>A: CleanupRunResult
